<meta name="body" content="Our division administers the Building, Code Compliance Services, Planning, and Sewer or On-Site Wastewater Treatment Systems (OWTS) departments. 

We provide inspections, permits, and current codes for building projects, correct code violations, guidance for an array of planning and development services, and ensure proper onsite wastewater disposal in areas which are not served by municipal sewer. 

**See below exciting changes - Check out our Updates to the Land Development Code

Upcoming holiday hours - remember to check department closures.  

